      "writtenOn": "2023-09-21T22:15:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, that is a great idea! I am glad you put it in its own task assuming we have the ram space (which it seems like we do)",
      "parentUuid": "ba6651f9_d7a8e005",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 334,
