      "message": "We have so much RAM it is hard to come up with uses for it.  The build system claims `44092 bytes in RAM still available`, but that is based on a 64kB RAM area, when the datasheet actually says 256kB.  I have not bothered investigating how to properly tell the EC makefiles that this part has four times the RAM they think.",
